    {
      "Seq": 11,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I find myself among the alleys, in the morning. This place is a shelf of iron pitted with marks where tides leave their marks, each a small world. Around me are a sand flat, a thicket of bushes, a crab, and a rocky shore. I watch the tide pool, a dark mark on the golden plain, anemones at its bottom, a dangerous thing to ignore. I let my focus go, nothing more here is worth my wary urban gaze.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 12,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I mark the dark, wide, flat sand left by the tide. A survivor\u0027s eye, wary of alleys and exits, draws me close. I\u0027ll test the practical skill needed to stay alive in this harsh place.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 13,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I need not look at the sand flat closely, for action calls. Better to eat what\u0027s here and last till morning.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 14,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I won\u0027t delve into the sand flat closely, for it draws no insight, and I rethink my course. I could plunge into the golden plain flat, instead. I\u0027ll trust the tying and handling of ropes and knots to navigate this flat.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 15,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I sought the soft earth, but my hands alone lack the strength. A shovel is needed, and with it, I dig deep into the sand\u0027s embrace.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
